                    );
                }
            }
        } else {
            System.out.println(
                "The problem is not solved. " +
                "Maybe you gave wrong data."
            );
        }
 
    }
 
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new ZeroOneKnapsackForTourists();
    }
 
